---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';import {site} from '../data/site';
---
<Layout title="About & credits"><div class="wrap"><PageHeader title="A student’s notebook, shared." description="D.El.Ed Buddy is a free, independent project created to make D.El.Ed study material easier to find, understand and revise." kicker="ABOUT D.EL.ED BUDDY" back="/about/" backLabel="About"/><div class="two-col"><article class="content-panel prose"><h2>Why this exists</h2><p>Classes move quickly. Notes end up across notebooks, PDFs and messaging apps. Finding the right topic shouldn’t take longer than studying it.</p><p>This project brings those pieces together, starting with Semester 1 of the Assam D.El.Ed programme. It will grow alongside the course — one class, one note and one useful resource at a time.</p><h2>What you’ll find here</h2><p>The official syllabus gives each course its structure. Original student notes, revision material and practical guidance will be added as they become ready. Material that needs more sources or review stays unpublished.</p><h2>How content is labelled</h2><ul><li><strong>Official:</strong> an identified original document or clearly marked syllabus extract.</li><li><strong>Leo’s Notes:</strong> notes actually prepared by Sayeem.</li><li><strong>Student Resource:</strong> original community material with an author.</li><li><strong>AI-assisted:</strong> generated material is labelled honestly. Owner-supplied notes may be published at the owner’s request without implying an independent review; new generated drafts require review.</li><li><strong>Reference:</strong> supporting links or summaries, with a source.</li></ul></article><aside class="feature-panel"><span class="eyebrow">DEVELOPED & MAINTAINED BY</span><div class="creator-monogram">SS</div><h2>Sayeem Sadik</h2><p>Also known online as <strong>Leo Aristocrat</strong>.</p><p>A fellow D.El.Ed student, building a useful place for the things we learn.</p><h3>Find Leo online</h3><div class="personal-links">{Object.entries(site.links).map(([name,url])=>url.startsWith('YOUR_')?<span>{name==='github'?'GitHub':name.charAt(0).toUpperCase()+name.slice(1)} <small>Link coming later</small></span>:<a href={url}>{name} ↗</a>)}</div><h3 class="spaced">More from Leo</h3><p class="small">Other projects will appear here when their details are ready.</p></aside></div><section class="content-panel spaced prose" id="disclaimer"><h2>Independent, always.</h2><p>D.El.Ed Buddy is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or operated by SCERT Assam, NCTE, or any government authority. Official notices, regulations and schedules should always be checked at the original source.</p><h3>Content & copyright</h3><p>Share original notes, original diagrams, permitted material and properly attributed references. Do not upload paid textbooks or copyrighted study material without permission. Being listed in a syllabus does not give permission to copy a book.</p><h3>Credits</h3><p>Curriculum source: State Council of Educational Research & Training, Assam, Revised Curriculum-Syllabus 2024. Design and implementation were AI-assisted. No generated notes are presented as Leo’s writing or as human-reviewed work.</p><h3 id="contact">Contact & corrections</h3><p>A contact link has not been provided yet. This section will be updated when Sayeem adds one. For official matters, contact your institution or the original issuing authority.</p></section></div></Layout>
